  "releaseNotes": "Added support for SOLIDWORKS 2026.\nAdded methods for selecting, deselecting and getting selected objects to SelectionManager.\nAdded callbacks to command manager buttons.\nAdded PersistentID and SketchSegmentId object.\nAdded getting started to the readme.\nAdded getting and setting a note's text.\nAdded getting preview images.\nAdded dispatch wrapper.\nAdded Directory.Build.Props for variables like solidworks and product version.\nChanged Component.AsModel to return null if the underlying object is null.\nCleaned up folder structure, projects, tools and license.\nFixed returning an emtpy list of configurations for drawings.\nFixed missing feature type names.",
